Subject: Cantor Procedure Tool CLI

Description: Canonical authority for one effectless executable JSON adapter over the already released CPPE-I08 fake provider-neutral tool controller. It makes the experiment callable without authorizing a provider, model, live inference junction, persistence, network, hidden-state access, or production operation.

